    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d94aa2cb5ac806b7448def5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我坐在长椅上深深叹了口气。\n一方面觉得只要西沙里奥玩得开心就好，\n另一方面又忍不住为自己的狼狈感到沮丧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6beb394ebe321e024b457e93b79e380f4878d2f5826499c6b6588b04c74acea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a23fe55f8de1a6f021ae424a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，即便到了遥远的未来\n我也一定不会忘记今天。\n这是增进了彼此了解的美好一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c23af79ba69fde8246ef156f65b2d20229b64388990df57e680d982c668bf1ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
