      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为大人，我必须好好带西沙里奥游玩。\n我一手拿着收藏了大量游乐园攻略的手机\n向她提出建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5164120b8419cb78b6c549bb2f6cfc7ff99d3bd56baaf6fd756f0bd746db8c94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
